// Companion fixture for `transactor_forward_ref_consumer_test.harc`
// (issue #301). This file declares `ProducerXact`, the transactor
// type referenced by `ConsumerXact.src` in the consumer fixture.
// It appears LATER in the source list — that's the regression
// trigger.
//
// Named with the `_sim.harc` suffix so the `all_fixtures_emit_cleanly`
// sweep and the `runtime_randomize_boundary_sweep` auto-pair it with
// its base file (consumer first, sim sibling second) — preserving the
// source-order ordering that triggers the bug.

transactor ProducerXact
    hookable count() -> uint<32>
        return 0u32
    end count
end transactor ProducerXact
